    <Row Tag="LOC_JAC_ASN_SELECT" Language="ja_JP">
      <Text>募集は都市を指定。暗殺は地図上の暗殺者を選び、対象の近くへ移動して実行。</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_JAC_ASN_SELECT" Language="en_US">
      <Text>Choose a city to recruit. Select an assassin on the map and move near a target to attempt a mission.</Text>
    </Row>
